This project has a graphify knowledge graph at `graphify-out/` (repo root).

- Before architecture or codebase questions, read `graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md` for god nodes and communities
- Prefer `graphify-out/wiki/index.md` → `graphify-out/wiki/NiftyDOS.md` over reading raw files when exploring NiftyDOS
- NiftyDOS session context: `core/strategies/IBBM/NiftyDOS/NIFTYDOS_GRAPH_CONTEXT.md`
- After modifying code in a session, from repo root run:
  1. `graphify update .` (AST-only, no API cost)
  2. `graphify export wiki` (refresh wiki articles for Cursor navigation)

Git: `graphify-out/cache/`, `graph.json`, and `graph.html` are in `.gitignore` (regenerate locally). `GRAPH_REPORT.md` and `wiki/` are local graphify artifacts under `graphify-out/`.
